    {
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 127.04,
      "text": "For example, if there is a book in English, you can upload it on PDF and it will scan that PDF."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.94,
      "end": 135.84,
      "text": "So when you put the picture in the examination, for example, if the test of that book has been done,"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.1,
      "end": 141.62,
      "text": "it will examine it and its score will tell you how accurate it is and how much we can do according to it."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.84,
      "end": 144.12,
      "text": "There are different things in which we can integrate AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 176.23,
      "end": 184.66,
      "text": "that our work is being done in such a way that our human resources are being used in such a way that it becomes easy for them."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.16,
      "end": 186.12,
      "text": "It becomes a kind of epithet."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.64,
      "end": 191.66,
      "text": "What other things can we integrate in the rest of the reporting?"
    },
    {
      "start": 191.98,
      "end": 196.06,
      "text": "I mean most of the things are in our manual but most of the things are also in our online."
    },
    {
      "start": 226.7,
      "end": 239.78,
      "text": "So when you think about all the workflows that we are doing, you will tell me about it and I will recommend it to you that we can integrate it in this way and it will be integrated in this way."
    }
  ]
